    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4021" root="تلب" body-key="t">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَلْبٌ</span></b>  <i>Loss;</i> or the <i>state of being lost;</i> or <i>perdition.</i> (A, K.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبًّا لَهُ تَلْبًا</span>, (Lth, T,) or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبًّا لَهُ وَتَلْبًا</span> [which may be rendered May God
decree <i>loss and perdition to him</i>]. (K.)

